      "content": "i don't think i want noise. that's the thing. i feel like i'm just going through the motions. i wake up, i eat, i sleep, and it's just like... what's the actual purpose? he was the only thing that made sense. now everything just feels like this big, meaningless loop of waiting for the next bad thing to happen.",
